      "id": "claim_e1b071d0b9a24dfcb9a4a3acff490687",
      "statement": "The @chrysalyst/server Hono app chains GET /health (status 200, body { status: 'ok', version } read from packages/server/package.json via static JSON import) and the three interview routes onto one instance; an undefined route returns 404, and app.test.ts checks health via app.request(...) without binding a socket.",
